<Item XName="EquationText" Type="PartParam">
<DataEntry>weight = zeros(NumOfCH,1);&#x000D;&#x000A;for n = 1 : NumOfCH&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x0009;weight(n) = input{n};&#x000D;&#x000A;end&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;%% Define Theta Sweep across the 1-D Antenna Array&#x000D;&#x000A;d = D;  % unit: wavelength&#x000D;&#x000A;k = 2 * pi * d;&#x000D;&#x000A;array_el = [0 : 15].&apos;;&#x000D;&#x000A;theta = [LowLim_Theta : Step_Theta : UpLim_Theta] * pi / 180;&#x000D;&#x000A;v = exp(j * k * array_el * sin(theta));&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;%% Assign Pattern with Weightings from ADBF&#x000D;&#x000A;pattern = zeros(1, length(theta));&#x000D;&#x000A;tmp = weight&apos; * v;&#x000D;&#x000A;pattern = abs(tmp);&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;output = pattern(:);</DataEntry>
<Description>Equation Text to Parse, edited in the equation set</Description>
<DocSymbol />
